0 FILE 21013 - Big Ben.ldr
0 The complete Big Ben clock tower model, featuring a tan brick tower with tiled surfaces, a black nameplate base reading 'Big Ben', and multiple detailed sub-assemblies forming the ornate clock face, spire, and decorative roof elements.
0 Name: 21013 - Big Ben.ldr
0 Author: Greg Teft [gregteft]
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
